        "content": "<h3>Presentation and demo</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://netresearch.github.io/modularer-ki-stack-page/vortraege/vorlage/\">Current event-neutral presentation</a></li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/modularer-ki-stack-page/blob/main/talks/vorlage/QUELLEN.md#bildnachweise\">Image credits and capture dates</a></li><li><a href=\"https://typo3-demo.netresearch.de/\">Public TYPO3 demo</a></li><li><a href=\"https://typo3-demo.netresearch.de/typo3/main\">TYPO3 backend · login required</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.netresearch.de/blog/ki-kennzeichnung-auf-websites-was-jetzt-wirklich-gekennzeichnet-werden-muss/\">Source article of the Repurpose example</a></li></ul>",
