        "_position": 2,
        "sys_language_uid": 0
      },
      "set": {
        "content": "<h3>nr-llm documentation and source code</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Administration/Tasks.rst\">Tasks: input and configuration</a> (slide 16)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Classes/Service/Feature/CompletionService.php\">How it works and source evidence</a> (slide 39)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Developer/QualityEvaluation.rst\">How it works and source evidence</a> (slide 40)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Administration/Skills.rst\">How it works and source evidence</a> (slide 41)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Administration/McpServers.rst\">How it works and source evidence</a> (slide 42)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Classes/Service/Tool/ToolLoopService.php\">How it works and source evidence</a> (slide 43)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Classes/Service/Feature/CompletionServiceInterface.php\">Interfaces and source evidence</a> (slide 44)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Classes/Service/Tool/Builtin/SiteRagQueryTool.php\">Interfaces and source evidence</a> (slide 45)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Classes/Provider/AbstractProvider.php\">Interfaces and source evidence</a> (slide 46)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Administration/Models.rst\">Model choice and capabilities</a> (slide 47)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Classes/Provider/Middleware/FallbackMiddleware.php\">Fallback in the source code</a> (slide 47)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Classes/Service/Tool/ToolCallPolicy.php\">Tool permissions in the source code</a> (slide 48)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Administration/Tools.rst\">Write permissions and approvals</a> (slide 48)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Administration/AgentRuns.rst\">Run timeline and limits</a> (slide 49)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Administration/DataRetention.rst\">Retention and deletion run</a> (slide 49)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Administration/UserBudgets.rst\">Budgets and their limits</a> (slide 51)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Api/DecisionService.rst\">DecisionService and integration</a> (slide 56)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Classes/Domain/Enum/TrustZone.php\">Zones and assignment</a> (slide 57)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Classes/Service/Tool/ToolDataClassResolver.php\">Tool classes</a> (slide 57)</li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm/blob/5b6fca6de8d9593638486c0baca9424934bdc231/Documentation/Adr/Adr149CriteriaModeZoneFromTheResolvedModel.rst\">Dynamic model selection</a> (slide 58)</li><l